{
    "m_SGVersion": 0,
    "m_Type": "UnityEditor.ShaderGraph.StickyNoteData",
    "m_ObjectId": "4b25798bfa264868884790a177a8022e",
    "m_Title": "Nodes",
    "m_Content": "The node are equivalent of the functions we can use in CG/HLSL. For example, the Clamp node run this function:\n\nvoid Unity_Clamp_float4(float4 In, float4 Min, float4 Max, out float4 Out)\r\n{\r\n    Out = clamp(In, Min, Max);\r\n}\n\nThe same function can be used in a HLSL shader.",
    "m_TextSize": 0,
    "m_Theme": 0,
    "m_Position": {
        "serializedVersion": "2",
        "x": -1528.0,
        "y": -497.0,
        "width": 563.0,
        "height": 160.0
    },
    "m_Group": {
        "m_Id": "5ac91a471ce44c2ea45718d0fd16a33f"
    }
}

